{"title":"Career roadmap · Marketplace Analyst","role":"Marketplace Analyst","summary":"A Marketplace Analyst analyses the performance of online marketplaces, sellers, products, customers, pricing, traffic, inventory and transactions to improve sales, conversion, profitability and marketplace growth.","facts":{"Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM","Course":"BBA – Digital Business / E-Commerce / Social Media"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For BBA – Digital Business / E-Commerce / Social Media, this is a strong direct alignment."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA Digital Business/E-Commerce","E-Commerce/Marketplace Internship","Marketplace Analyst / E-Commerce Analyst","Senior Marketplace Analyst","Marketplace Manager / Category Manager","Senior Marketplace Manager","Head of Marketplace / E-Commerce"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career objective"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build e-commerce, marketplace, Excel, SQL, analytics, pricing and digital-marketing skills. Complete 2–3 internships."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Specialise in marketplace analytics, category analytics, seller analytics, pricing or growth."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Move into Marketplace Manager, Category Manager, E-Commerce Manager or Marketplace Strategy roles."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Lead marketplace strategy, category portfolios, seller ecosystems and digital-commerce growth."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"E-commerce fundamentals"},{"text":"Digital business, marketing, economics"},{"text":"E-commerce business analysis"},{"text":"Business foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Excel + basic analytics